	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Keep the Mac awake from Alfred with the Sleepless menu bar app.

Type "sleepless" to see whether the Mac is awake and pick an action: keep it awake, let it sleep, choose a duration, or release one hold when several are active. Hold ⌥ on a duration to flip the display setting.

Give the Hotkey trigger a key to toggle Sleepless without opening Alfred.

The workflow looks for Sleepless.app in /Applications, then for a running copy. If the app lives somewhere else, set its location in the workflow's configuration.</string>
